Darina Haos, [28.05.2026 21:57]
Членство:
Membership in UEAVA is more than simply joining a professional association — it is becoming part of a community of veterinary professionals dedicated to advancing modern exotic animal medicine in Ukraine.

What UEAVA Members Receive

Access to Professional Literature and Educational Resources

Members gain access to educational materials, clinical guidelines, scientific publications, and valuable resources related to exotic animal medicine.

Educational Webinars and Professional Development

UEAVA regularly organizes webinars, lectures, and educational events featuring both Ukrainian and international specialists in exotic animal medicine.

Discounts on Conferences and Educational Events

Members of the association receive special participation terms and discounts for conferences, workshops, and other educational events organized by UEAVA.

Inclusion in the Directory of Exotic Animal Veterinarians in Ukraine

UEAVA members may be included in the public directory of veterinary professionals working with exotic animals, helping pet owners find qualified specialists across Ukraine.

Professional Community and Peer Support

UEAVA is a community of like-minded professionals where members can exchange experience, discuss clinical cases, receive support from colleagues, and grow together within a strong professional network.

Contribution to the Development of Exotic Animal Medicine in Ukraine

By becoming a member of the association, you contribute to the development of the professional veterinary community, the promotion of evidence-based medicine, and the establishment of modern standards of care for exotic animals in Ukraine.

